Just one of those lazy afternoons...
Here's a patch that adds more shuffled item descriptions for your
hedonistic satisfaction.
You may notice that some of them are from Rogue, and the cameo and
intaglio rings are from Slash'EM (though commented out.)

It adds the following WAND appearances:

birch
redwood
walnut
mahogany
elm
cedar
palmwood
yew
chrome
titanium
nickel
mithril
silicon
grooved
bent
cracked
gnarled
plastic
bone
alabaster
orichalcum
electrum

It adds the following SCROLL labels:

ETAOIN SHRDLU
LOREM IPSUM
KLAATU BARADA NIKTO
FNORD
POTRZEBIE
NOMEN NESCIO

(All of the above scroll labels have Wikipedia pages explaining their
meaning.)

It adds the following POTION colours:

creamy
beige
burgundy
syrupy
gelatinous
frothy
congealed
ochre
mauve
indigo
silver

(NOTE: the addition of extra potion colours is incompatable with the
Color Alchemy patch, which requires that every potion colour be
available in every game. Color Alchemy users are requested to remove or
comment-out these additions.)

It adds the following RING descriptions:

cameo
intaglio
mithril
platinum
black opal
jacinth
