rectangular
deltoid
elliptic
pentagonal
octahedral

It adds the following SPELLBOOK appearances:

crimson
glossy
notepaper
creased
foolscap
bookmarked
string-bound
fan-fold
typewritten
legal pad
crayon
charcoal
scrawled
scribbled
illuminated

Nothing new though for helms, boots, gloves and cloaks, though.
Suggestions are welcome.

It also corrects the following related to object materials:
* Pearl rings are now mineral rather than iron.
* Opal rings are now gemstone rather than mineral.
* Jeweled wands are now gemstone rather than iron.

